&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE AfterDeleteRecord DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE AfterDeleteRecord :

    for each nc-aud-procedimento exclusive-lock
       where nc-aud-procedimento.nr-seq-aud-proced = RowObject.nr-seq-aud-proced:
        delete nc-aud-procedimento.
    end.


END PROCEDURE.

